### =========================================================================
### PRUEBAS DE INTEGRACIÓN: BANK USAC (SAGA DE TRANSFERENCIAS)
### Puedes ejecutar esto usando la extensión "REST Client" en VSCode
### =========================================================================

@gateway_url = http://localhost:3000/api

### 1. Crear Cuenta Origen (Andrés)
# @name createSource
POST {{gateway_url}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cust-andres-01",
  "type": "MONETARIA",
  "balance": 5000.00
}

###

### 2. Crear Cuenta Destino (Universidad)
# @name createTarget
POST {{gateway_url}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cust-usac-02",
  "type": "MONETARIA",
  "balance": 0.00
}

###

### 3. Extraer IDs (Copia los IDs de las respuestas de arriba y pégalos aquí)
@sourceId = {{createSource.response.body.id}}
@targetId = {{createTarget.response.body.id}}

### 4. INICIAR LA SAGA: Realizar Transferencia (Q. 1500 de Andrés a la USAC)
# @name transfer
POST {{gateway_url}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccount": "{{sourceId}}",
  "targetAccount": "{{targetId}}",
  "amount": 1500.00
}

###

### 5. Verificar Saldo Origen (Debería ser 3500.00)
GET {{gateway_url}}/accounts/{{sourceId}}/balance

###

### 6. Verificar Saldo Destino (Debería ser 1500.00)
GET {{gateway_url}}/accounts/{{targetId}}/balance

###

### 7. Verificar Historial de Transacciones de Andrés
GET {{gateway_url}}/transactions/customer/cust-andres-01

### =========================================================================
### PRUEBA DE RESILIENCIA (Fallo en la transacción por fondos insuficientes)
### =========================================================================

### 8. Intentar transferir Q. 10000 (Saga debe fallar y hacer rollback)
POST {{gateway_url}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccount": "{{sourceId}}",
  "targetAccount": "{{targetId}}",
  "amount": 10000.00
}
